msgid ""
"ShellJS is a portable **(Windows/Linux/OS X)** implementation of Unix "
"shell commands on top of the Node.js API. You can use it to eliminate "
"your shell script's dependency on Unix while still keeping its familiar "
"and powerful commands. You can also install it globally so you can run it"
" from outside Node projects - say goodbye to those gnarly Bash scripts!"
