msgid "exec(command [, options] [, callback])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/shelljs_README.md:306
msgid ""
"`async`: Asynchronous execution. If a callback is provided, it will be "
"set to `true`, regardless of the passed value (default: `false`)."
msgstr ""

